# Publication hygiene: user-supplied game content, vendor binaries and Sony-owned art never enter the repo
#
# patches/ is entirely absent from the repository, Bloodborne.xml included: it is community
# patch data whose authors (Kyo, illusion, auser1337, emoose, ...) granted no redistribution
# rights, and shadps4-emu/ps4_cheats carries no LICENSE (defaults to all rights reserved).
# It is still required to start — scripts/patches.py defaults --xml to patches/Bloodborne.xml
# and refuses to run without it — so tools/fetch_patches.sh pulls it and patches.py names the
# file in its error when it is missing.
/patches/
/dumps/
/savedata/
/sys_modules/
/mods/
/dlss/
/nvngx*.dll
/patches-stamp.json
/logo/bloodborne.png
/logo/bg2.jpg
/logo/bg3.png
/logo/bg.png
